# 機密や開発成果物をコンテナイメージに焼き込まないようにする
# (azd deploy → docker build の際に参照される)
# Prevent secrets and development artifacts from being included in the container image
# (referenced during azd deploy → docker build)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.venv/
venv/
.azure/
.git/
.gitignore
.vscode/
.idea/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ローカル動作確認用 (Hosted Agent コンテナでは使わない)
# Used for local testing (not used in the Hosted Agent container)
local.py
